<title>USA: Tower Air Inc Aug traffic slips.</title>
<headline>Tower Air Inc Aug traffic slips.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Month Ended August 31,</p>
<p>						 1996	1995     Change</p>
<p>Available seat miles (millions)	   563	 584    -3.6%</p>
<p>Revenue passengers carried (thousands)  159	 166    -4.2%</p>
<p>Revenue passenger miles (millions)	455	 498    -8.6%</p>
